    "egt_beta_sensitivity.csv": "one row per (mutation_rule, beta, mutation, max_private_risk) with the four strategy shares as columns; each share and the aggregate Unsafe fraction carry a chain mean, a chain minimum, a chain maximum, and a between-chain range, and the Unsafe fraction additionally carries a between-chain standard deviation and standard error; mixing_suspect marks a cell whose independent chains did not demonstrably mix"
